{
  "group": "selectors",
  "upstream": "cheerio@1.0.0",
  "note": "Every case runs $(selector) upstream and Document.Find(selector) in Go over the named fixture. Results are compared as tag-name / id / text vectors so that document order is part of the comparison.",
